<title>INDIA: India 96/97 rice output seen at 88 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 rice output seen at 88 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's rice production in the crop year 1996/97 (October-September) has been estimated at 88 million tonnes, compared with 79.46 million tonnes in 1995/96, a Food Ministry statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figure was included in a table released as a statement by the ministry.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom, +91-11-3012024</p>
